{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2550\u2550 Demo Now Available! \u2550\u2550 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version is out now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and get an early taste of the world of Little Recollector!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/a6e0302c8fdbc3072697b8b00d427f57.avif?t=1772006731\" width=1283 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access it here!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless small islands float across an endless sky,<br>and humanity has moved its way of life into the heavens above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annie, a girl who loves researching and modifying relics,<br>and her bird companion, Tristan,<br>make their living as <strong>Re-collectors</strong>, retrieving relics from the collapsing ruins known as <strong>Worseth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal is simple!<br><strong>Modify their floating island into a base</strong><br><br><br><strong>and explore every last corner of Worseth drifting through the sky.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fund their upgrades,<br>they head to Worseth again today,<br>seeking <strong>more</strong> and <strong>more valuable</strong> treasures to bring back home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6The Adventure Isn\u2019t Over Until You Bring It Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Harsh and Tense 2D Platform Action Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across platforms and keep climbing upward,<br>escaping the relentless collapse rising from below<br>in this <strong>upward-scrolling 2D platform action game</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins to gather treasures,<br>then escape the tower to finally secure your haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned\u2014<br>if you are caught in the collapse,<br>all the treasures you collected will be lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/71d34a511d821fad9fb3ab1c1a0bbca5.poster.avif?t=1772006731\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/71d34a511d821fad9fb3ab1c1a0bbca5.webm?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/71d34a511d821fad9fb3ab1c1a0bbca5.mp4?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Treasure Hunting Isn\u2019t That Simple!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, Knowing When to Give Up Is the Key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type of treasure requires different actions to retrieve.<br>Hesitate for too long, and the collapse will quickly close in from below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed can be dangerous\u2014<br>judging when to retreat is just as important as pressing forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/c179e41a2b9ebb49411603d8a2f0bcd2.poster.avif?t=1772006731\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/c179e41a2b9ebb49411603d8a2f0bcd2.webm?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/c179e41a2b9ebb49411603d8a2f0bcd2.mp4?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6No Time to Linger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Outside, Rush to the Escape Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing exploration inside the tower, the escape phase begins!<br>The ruins collapse in earnest, and a black hole starts to form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock,<br>jumping across floating debris<br>to reach the cannon that will send you back to your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy crystals floating along the way are also valuable resources\u2014<br>collect as many as you can and make it home safely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/04f604551b95d41bc788e1aaea563644.poster.avif?t=1772006731\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/04f604551b95d41bc788e1aaea563644.webm?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/04f604551b95d41bc788e1aaea563644.mp4?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888480?t=1772006731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888480?t=1772006731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/d9621de4a8f5ace8bef7ced76666a389950cc280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772006731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/d9621de4a8f5ace8bef7ced76666a389950cc280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772006731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4417810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag