!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock,<br>jumping across floating debris<br>to reach the cannon that will send you back to your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy crystals floating along the way are also valuable resources\u2014<br>collect as many as you can and make it home safely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/04f604551b95d41bc788e1aaea563644.poster.avif?t=1772006731\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/04f604551b95d41bc788e1aaea563644.webm?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/extras/04f604551b95d41bc788e1aaea563644.mp4?t=1772006731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["UNICO INC."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888480/e9bc49c5e2c98748f2cb53bc620396841fdba59e/header.jpg?t=1772006731","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Little Re-collector","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX660 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows compatible sound card</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["UNICO INC."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_